.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt AETERNUM-SPLASH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm aeternum-splash
.Nd play the Aeternum boot animation
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility plays the Aeternum Security OS boot animation full screen, on top of
other windows, without sound and without controls.
It is started from the desktop session by the autostart entry
.Pa aeternum-splash.desktop ,
so the animation plays after the user logs in.
.Pp
The animation is the file
.Pa /usr/local/share/aeternum/boot-animation.mp4 ,
played with
.Xr mpv 1 .
If the file or
.Xr mpv 1
is missing,
.Nm
exits silently with status 0.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/share/aeternum/boot-animation.mp4
The animation.
.It Pa /usr/local/share/aeternum/skel/.config/autostart/aeternum-splash.desktop
Autostart entry.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mpv 1 ,
.Xr aeternum 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Zef Lleshaj
